  "content": "<p>The last stained glass workshop brought another round of impressive results, with participants creating beautiful pieces despite having no prior experience in glass art.</p><p>Expanding the workshop capacity worked out really well, allowing more people to get hands-on time and complete their own projects.</p><p>The next course is already fully booked, but Hannah is currently offering these workshops on a regular basis, so more opportunities are coming up soon.</p>",
